    "text": "To determine how many avocados Allie needs, we can follow these steps:\n\n1. **Calculate the total number of servings needed:**\n   Since there are 42 people at the party, including Allie, and each batch serves about 6 people, we need to find out how many batches are required.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Number of batches} = \\frac{42 \\text{ people}}{6 \\text{ people per batch}} = 7 \\text{ batches}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Determine the total number of avocados needed:**\n   Each batch requires 4 avocados. Therefore, for 7 batches, the total number of avocados required is:\n   \\[\n   \\text{Total avocados} = 7 \\text{ batches} \\times 4 \\text{ avocados per batch} = 28 \\text{ avocados}\n   \\]\n\nThus, Allie needs \\(\\boxed{28}\\) avocados.",
